---

Roost orchestrates third-party Android runtimes (such as a Windows Subsystem
for Android build or an emulator) over the Android Debug Bridge. It bundles no
Google or third-party binaries. "Android" is a trademark of Google LLC; Roost
is not affiliated with or endorsed by Google.
